---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../config.js';
---
<Base title={`About | ${SITE.name}`} description="Who publishes The Style News.">
  <p class="kicker">About</p>
  <h1>About The Style News</h1>
  <div class="body">
    <p>The Style News writes about men's clothing with one question in mind: what is
    actually worth owning, and how do you tell the difference?</p>

    <p>The Style News is published by <strong>Son of John B.V.</strong>, an Amsterdam
    boxer short label. Articles here feature and link to Son of John products, and we
    say so on every article rather than burying it. Where we recommend something outside
    our own range, we make no money from it.</p>

    <p>Questions or corrections: <a href="mailto:hello@thestylenews.com">hello@thestylenews.com</a></p>
  </div>
</Base>
